  m_text: 'Fishing Note


    WASD - Move

    Mouse - Look Around

    E - Interact

    1
    - Equip Rod

    2 - Equip Bucket

    Left Mouse - Use Equipped Item


    Goal:

    Talk
    to the merchant first.

    Then use the sign to start fishing.

    Submit enough
    fish before time runs out.'
